F THE 7060X5 SERIES WITH THE ADDITION OF 800G, WHICH DOUBLES THE CAPACITY OF HYPERSCALE BACKBONES WHILE REDUCING SPACE AND POWER PER GIGABIT.'}{'symbol': 'AIZ', 'date': '2022-12-14 08:30:00', 'title': 'ASSURANT AIMS TO REDUCE GREENHOUSE GAS EMISSIONS BY 40 PERCENT BY 2030', 'text': "NEW YORK--( BUSINESS WIRE )--ASSURANT, INC. (NYSE: AIZ), A LEADING GLOBAL BUSINESS SERVICES COMPANY THAT SUPPORTS, PROTECTS AND CONNECTS MAJOR CONSUMER PURCHASES, TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS GOAL TO REDUCE GREENHOUSE GAS (GHG) EMISSIONS BY 40 PERCENT BY 2030. THE TARGET, WHICH ALIGNS WITH THE PARIS AGREEMENT AND THE SCIENCE-BASED TARGETS INITIATIVE (SBTI), WAS SET AS PART OF THE COMPANY'S ENVIRONMENTAL, SOCIAL AND GOVERNANCE (ESG) GUIDING PRINCIPLE TO ENSURE ITS FACILITIES AROUND THE WORLD ADHERE TO SUSTAINABILITY PRACTICES."}{'symbol': 'BAC', 'date': '2022-12-14 09:00:00', 'title': 'BOFA PROVIDES NEARLY $19 MILLION TO LOCAL HUNGER ORGANIZATIONS FROM EMPLOYEE BOOSTER CAMPAIGN', 'text': 'MORE THAN $150M DISTRIBUTED TO HELP FIGHT FOOD INSECURITY SINCE 2015 NEW YORK , DEC. 14, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- BANK OF AMERICA ANNOUNCED TODAY IT WILL DONATE AN ADDITIONAL $8 MILLION TO LOCAL HUNGER ORGANIZATIONS FROM ITS SECOND EMPLOYEE BOOSTER CAMPAIGN.\xa0 AS A RESULT, NEARLY $19 MILLION WILL BE DISTRIBUTED TO HUNGER RELIEF ORGANIZATIONS IN LOCAL COMMUNITIES ACROSS THE U.S. AND PUERTO RICO.'}{'symbol': 'BRK-B', 'date': '2022-12-14 13:45:00', 'title': 'BERKSHIRE HATHAWAY HOMESERVICES ANNOUNCES GLOBAL EXPANSION IN\xa0ARUBA', 'text': 'ORANJESTAD, ARUBA--( BUSINESS WIRE )--BERKSHIRE HATHAWAY HOMESERVICES, A GLOBAL RESIDENTIAL REAL ESTATE BROKERAGE FRANCHISE NETWORK IS PLEASED TO ANNOUNCE ITS FURTHER EXPANSION IN ARUBA WITH THE ADDITION OF HOMECITY ARUBA REAL ESTATE. THE ADDITION MARKS THE BRAND´S FIRST LOCATION IN THE COUNTRY AND ITS CONTINUED STRATEGIC GLOBAL GROWTH. THE COMPANY WILL OPERATE AS BERKSHIRE HATHAWAY HOMESERVICES ARUBA REALTY.'}{'symbol': 'BR', 'date': '2022-12-14 06:45:00', 'title': 'AMID A VOLATILE 